          "event": "edited",
          "note": "Fix the independent Codex review findings: reject-view property and picture checks, dangling relationship ids, reordered values in science_guard, inherited-style unset, vertical alignment swaps, no-break-space merges, empty rewrites, structured-abstract word counts, empty comments parts, track-revisions switch; resumable intake, author-save and retarget; project mutation lock; relative journal-profile and drift paths."
